#: main.cpp:84
msgid ""
"<h1>Icons</h1>This module allows you to choose the icons for your "
"desktop."
"<p>To choose an icon theme, click on its name and apply your choice by "
"pressing the \"Apply\" button below. If you don't want to apply your choice "
"you can press the \"Reset\" button to discard your changes.</p>"
"<p>By pressing the \"Install New Theme\" button you can install your new "
"icon theme by writing its location in the box or browsing to the location. "
"Press the \"OK\" button to finish the installation.</p>"
"<p>The \"Remove Theme\" button will only be activated if you select a theme "
"that you installed using this module. You are not able to remove globally "
"installed themes here.</p>"
"<p>You can also specify effects that should be applied to the icons.</p>"
msgstr ""

